ascii-reveal-legion
The Legion design system's loading and reveal engine.

This package is a fork of "ascii-reveal" by Quan Hoang
(https://github.com/quanhoangindex/ascii-reveal), released under the MIT License.
The original copyright notice and license text are kept, unchanged, in LICENSE.

Changes made in this fork: performance guardrails (setAsciiQuality, setAsciiLimits,
zero frames when idle), the `legion` preset and skeleton variant, the `antler`,
`thinking` and `legion-mark` mascots, AsciiLoader, the Legion theme (legion.css),
a rewrite of the skeleton scheduler, React 19 / Next 16 compatibility tests, and the
demo's Legion page. These changes were not made or endorsed by the original author.
The name "ascii-reveal" belongs to the original project; this fork is published
under a different name.
